# Janeway's entry explores a Forest to Bot1's hand; her own additional land play lets Bot1 play two Forests this turn but
# refuses a third. Ornithopter is another creature Bot1 controls, so its entry explores a nonland; Bot1 declines to bin it,
# leaving it on top while Ornithopter gets a +1/+1 counter. Bot2's Llanowar Elves doesn't trigger Janeway: had it
# explored, Bot2's Lightning Bolt on top would have given it a counter (CR 305.2, 603.6a,
# 701.44a).

